{"overview":{"Symbol":"KLC","Name":"KinderCare Learning Companies, Inc.","Description":"KinderCare Learning Companies, Inc. provides early childhood education and care services in the United States. The company offers community-based early childhood education services for infants, toddlers, preschool, and kindergarten students; and customized family care benefits for organizations, including care for young children on or near the site where their parents work, tuition benefits, and backup care under the KinderCare Learning Centers (KCLC) and Crème School brands. It also provides before-and after-school programs, including summer camp programs for preschool and school-age children under the Champions brand. The company was formerly known as KC Holdco, LLC and changed its name to KinderCare Learning Companies, Inc. in January 2022. KinderCare Learning Companies, Inc. was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Lake Oswego, Oregon.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Consumer Defensive","Industry":"Education & Training Services","Address":"5005 Meadows Road, Lake Oswego, OR, 97035, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"470160352","EBITDA":"251964992","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"3.978","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-3.58","RevenuePerShareTTM":"23.123","ProfitMargin":"-0.15483","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.02884","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.022149999","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.62519","RevenueTTM":"2737601024","GrossProfitTTM":"568499008","DilutedEPSTTM":"-3.58","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.006","AnalystTargetPrice":"4.24286","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"12.056609","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"0.17174174","PriceToBookRatio":"0.99798894","EVToRevenue":"1.045","EVToEBITDA":"11.357","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"10.83","52WeekLow":"1.75","50DayMovingAverage":"3.5492","200DayMovingAverage":"4.5683","SharesOutstanding":"118428299","DividendDate":"","ExDi